# PROJECT MASTER PROMPT
# TELEBIRR DRIVER COMPANION — ANDROID APP

## 1. Project Overview

I want to build a professional Android application for drivers in Ethiopia who receive payments through Telebirr.

The app should automatically detect incoming Telebirr transaction SMS messages from sender ID `127`, extract relevant payment information, organize payments, and help drivers understand how much money they earn from each trip.

The main problem this application solves is that drivers often struggle to notice incoming Telebirr payments while driving. They may not immediately see who sent the money or how much was received. They also need a simple way to track their income across individual trips.

The application should turn incoming Telebirr SMS notifications into organized financial records and connect those records to the driver's trips.

**The application should be offline-first, Android-focused, easy to use, reliable, and visually polished.**

Project name: **TripBirr** (working name; make it configurable).

